{"unit_id":"jackxu925__dsh-pwa#card-zh","repo":"jackxu925/dsh-pwa","commit":"361db0b25ca68fb0710991f88adb925b70f6a9bf","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pwa 是面向手机浏览器的 DSH PWA 界面，挂载在 DSH web 的 /m 路径，并通过同源 DSH API 操作会话。它提供会话列表与消息搜索、流式聊天、审批和 agent 问答交互，也可查看会话交付文件并使用系统分享。适合希望通过 iOS 或 Android 浏览器远程继续使用 DSH 的人；需要一台运行中的 DSH web 服务，不需要为本插件配置 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/routes.js:47-66","web/app.js:1744-1760","web/app.js:904-1005","web/app.js:2184-2200"]}
{"unit_id":"jackxu925__dsh-pwa#card-en","repo":"jackxu925/dsh-pwa","commit":"361db0b25ca68fb0710991f88adb925b70f6a9bf","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-pwa adds a phone-friendly PWA at /m on the DSH web server. It uses the same-origin API for session browsing and search, streaming chat, approvals, agent questions, and sharing session files. Use it from an iOS or Android browser with a running DSH web server; no plugin API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/routes.js:47-66","web/app.js:1744-1760","web/app.js:904-1005","web/app.js:2184-2200"]}
